{
  "id": "PRO.3",
  "number": "3",
  "bookId": "PRO",
  "reference": "Proverbs 3",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 35,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PRO 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "My son, forget not my law; but let thine heart keep my commandments:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For length of days, and long life, and peace, shall they add to thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let not mercy and truth forsake thee: bind them about thy neck; write them upon the table of thine heart:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So shalt thou find favour and good understanding in the sight of God and man.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Trust in the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.3.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.3.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with all thine heart; and lean not unto thine own understanding.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In all thy ways acknowledge him, and he shall direct thy paths.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Be not wise in thine own eyes: fear the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.3.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.3.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and depart from evil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It shall be health to thy navel, and marrow to thy bones.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Honour the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.3.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.3.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with thy substance, and with the firstfruits of all thine increase:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So shall thy barns be filled with plenty, and thy presses shall burst out with new wine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ My son, despise not the chastening of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.3.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.3.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; neither be weary of his correction:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For whom the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.3.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.3.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "loveth he correcteth; even as a father the son",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "in whom",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.3.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.3.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he delighteth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Happy",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.3.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.3.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the man",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.3.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.3.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "findeth wisdom, and the man",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.3.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.3.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "getteth understanding.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the merchandise of it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.3.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.3.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "better than the merchandise of silver, and the gain thereof than fine gold.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "She",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.3.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.3.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "more precious than rubies: and all the things thou canst desire are not to be compared unto her.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Length of days",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.3.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.3.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in her right hand;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.3.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.3.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in her left hand riches and honour.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Her ways",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.3.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.3.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ways of pleasantness, and all her paths",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.3.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.3.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "peace.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "She",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.3.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.3.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a tree of life to them that lay hold upon her: and happy",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is every one",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.3.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.3.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that retaineth her.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.3.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.3.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "by wisdom hath founded the earth; by understanding hath he established the heavens.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "By his knowledge the depths are broken up, and the clouds drop down the dew.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ My son, let not them depart from thine eyes: keep sound wisdom and discretion:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So shall they be life unto thy soul, and grace to thy neck.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then shalt thou walk in thy way safely, and thy foot shall not stumble.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When thou liest down, thou shalt not be afraid: yea, thou shalt lie down, and thy sleep shall be sweet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be not afraid of sudden fear, neither of the desolation of the wicked, when it cometh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.3.26",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.3.26"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be thy confidence, and shall keep thy foot from being taken.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Withhold not good from them to whom it is due, when it is in the power of thine hand to do",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.3.27",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.3.27"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Say not unto thy neighbour, Go, and come again, and to morrow I will give; when thou hast it by thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Devise not evil against thy neighbour, seeing he dwelleth securely by thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Strive not with a man without cause, if he have done thee no harm.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Envy thou not the oppressor, and choose none of his ways.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the froward",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.3.32",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.3.32"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abomination to the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.3.32",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.3.32"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ": but his secret",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.3.32",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.3.32"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with the righteous.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ The curse of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.3.33",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.3.33"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.3.33",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.3.33"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in the house of the wicked: but he blesseth the habitation of the just.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Surely he scorneth the scorners: but he giveth grace unto the lowly.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The wise shall inherit glory: but shame shall be the promotion of fools.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
